---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro'

const title = 'Disclaimer | Zyankov.eu'
const description = 'Limitations of the information, estimates and word lists provided by Zyankov.eu, Letterwell and BuildCalc.'
const jsonLd = {
  '@type': 'WebPage',
}
---

<PageLayout title={title} description={description} path="/disclaimer/" noAds={true} project="hub" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
      <p class="eyebrow">Important information</p>
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: November 4, 2026</p>
      <p class="intro">
        The tools and articles on Zyankov.eu provide general information for planning, learning and play. Please read the limitations below before relying on a result.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>No professional advice</h2>
        <p>Nothing on this site is professional, engineering, legal or financial advice. Results depend on the values and assumptions you enter, and no tool can account for every product, situation or rule.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>BuildCalc estimates</h2>
        <p>BuildCalc results are arithmetic estimates based on your measurements. Material density, coverage, site conditions, cutting, waste and packaging vary. Verify results with product documentation, suppliers and qualified professionals.</p>
        <p>Concrete volume estimates do not establish structural adequacy or building-code compliance. BuildCalc does not guarantee that an estimate will match the quantity you need or the price you are charged. Confirm quantities, delivery terms and project requirements before you order or start work.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Letterwell word lists</h2>
        <p>Letterwell searches openly licensed English and Bulgarian word lists. They can include or omit words differently from official game dictionaries, and the scores follow common letter values that some editions change. Check the rules and dictionary of the game you are playing.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Accuracy and availability</h2>
        <p>The content is checked carefully, but errors are possible and the tools may change or be unavailable. Nothing in this disclaimer limits rights that cannot be limited under applicable law. The <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a> apply to all projects.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Ads and external links</h2>
        <p>The site shows ads from Google AdSense and links to other websites. Zyankov.eu does not control the content of ads or external sites. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for how advertising works.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Found a mistake? Email <a href="mailto:hello@zyankov.eu">hello@zyankov.eu</a> with the page and a short description.</p>
      </section>
</PageLayout>
